k an adult to be nearby, move at your own comfortable level and stop if anything hurts or feels unsafe. You may always choose a gentler version or only describe the movement. One deliberate, reasoned change is more useful than a longer answer.","icon":"📖","notice":"Repeating the worked example cannot show transfer to a new situation. Change the choice or strategy, not just the wording.","title":"Transfer to a new situation"}],"title":"Year 4, Week 31, Lesson 2: Dance skills practice","unit_number":7,"unit_title":"Dance and gymnastics","week":31,"week_in_unit":1,"word_challenges":null,"worked_example":"WORK THROUGH THIS\nExample: travel-pathway-turn-balance sequence in personal space.\n\nWrite what makes this example safe, healthy or respectful, naming the cues, rules or choices used.","worked_visuals":[{"alt":"Dance skills.","caption":"Safe spacing.","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 150\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fff4ea\" stroke=\"#b87445\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#e8f5ed\" stroke=\"#297a61\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#263948\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"42\">Travel</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\">turn balance</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"42\">Space</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"78\">controlled</text></g></svg>"},{"alt":"Skills circuit.","caption":"One cue.","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 150\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fff4ea\" stroke=\"#b87445\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#e8f5ed\" stroke=\"#297a61\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#263948\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"42\">Circuit</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\">peer cue</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"42\">Risk</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"78\">crash for laughs</text></g></svg>"}],"year_level":"Year 4"}') WHERE seed_key='s2-pdhpe-y4-w31-l2' AND family_id IS NULL;
